> I was wondering whether there is any way to visualize the output of  
> an lmer-object, or rather, the output of pvals.fnc?

plotLMER.fnc in package LanguageR will allow you to add MCMC-based HPD  
intervals (from mcmcsamp or pvals.fnc$mcmc) to your plots.

